+**With a class in the file the crate cannot match, by D59.** The oracle, for `x.cls` defining
+`::class xk public`: `collected 1`, `same class 0`, `prologs 2`. Head: `collected 0`, `same class 1`,
+`prologs 1`. A class keeps its package (`RexxClass::package`), and the crate never collects a class
+(`.object~subclass('t')` in a WeakReference never clears, measured at head and before). See Concerns.
